---
description: Middlewares and guardrails guidance
globs:
  - "src/middlewares/**/*.ts"
  - "plugins/**/pii.ts"
  - "plugins/**/contentSafety.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Keep middleware stateless and composable. Inject dependencies instead of importing singletons.
- Validate and sanitize request payloads early (PII, content safety, prompt injection checks).
- Provide structured logs and telemetry contexts across middleware boundaries.
- Ensure cache keys are deterministic and include relevant headers/body fields.
- Make rate limits and safety thresholds configurable via env/config.

